OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Clara
OL,6,G     Schumann and her Circle
OL,7,     F3/5. Donald Macleod meets the
OL,8,     Ffriends (and foes) of composer
OL,9,     FClara Schumann. Today, her
OL,10,     Fmysteriously close relationship
OL,11,     Fwith Johannes Brahms.
OL,12,G1700 In Tune
OL,13,     FKatie Derham presents live jazz
OL,14,     Ffrom gayageum player Kyungso Park
OL,15,     Fand bassist Bjorn Meyer. Author
OL,16,     FSarah Fritz talks about her new
OL,17,     Fbiography of Clara Schumann.
